7. Test Coverage
Test coverage ensures that important system functionalities and possible failure conditions are tested. In this project, the tests covered valid inputs, invalid inputs, edge cases, and error conditions for critical components such as login, task creation, and task completion.
The login component was tested under multiple conditions, including: Correct email and password (valid conditions) and Incorrect password, Non-existing user, Invalid email format and Empty fields as invalid conditons.
The test coverage for the selected components is considered sufficient for validating the core functionality of the Smart Study Planner & Task Manager system.
The tests addressed: Expected behavior, Invalid inputs, Boundary conditions and Failure situations
